  "question": {
    "text": "In a slide caliper, $(m+1)$ number of vernier divisions is equal to $m$ number of smallest main scale divisions. If $d$ unit is the magnitude of the smallest main scale division, then the magnitude of the vernicr constant is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
