  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$(m+1)$ vernier division $=m$ main scale division One division on vernier scale $=\\left(\\frac{m}{m+1}\\right)$ division on main scale Vernier constant $=\\left(1-\\frac{m}{m+1}\\right) d=\\frac{d}{m+1}$",
